     "Dear all,<div><br></div><div>Cardinal 3.6 should be released tomorrow. This is a major update with some breaking changes (that we believe are worth it for the improvements).</div><div><br></div><div>If you have mission-critical workflows, I recommend testing this release on a separate machine first before updating.</div><div><br></div><div>Some highlights include:</div><div><br></div><div><ul style=\"font-size:16px;box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Quattrocento,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0px 10px;outline:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 35px;vertical-align:baseline;list-style:square;color:rgb(102,102,102)\"><li style=\"border:0px;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">Redesigned data structures<ul style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0px 10px;outline:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 35px;vertical-align:baseline;list-style:square\"><li style=\"border:0px;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">Updated <em style=\"border:0px;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">MSImagingExperiment</em> class for MS imaging data with shared m/z values</li><li style=\"border:0px;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">New <em style=\"border:0px;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">MSImagingArrays</em> class for MS imaging data with different m/z values</li></ul></li><li style=\"border:0px;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">All statistical methods (including PCA, PLS, spatial k-means, and spatial shrunken centroids) have been updated for improved speed and simpler storage of results</li><li style=\"border:0px;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">New pre-processing workflow with better support for high-resolution experiments</li><li style=\"border:0px;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">New support for multiple-instance learning</li><li style=\"border:0px;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">New plotting engine</li></ul><div><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Quattrocento, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><span><br></span></font></div></div><div>-Kylie</div><div><br></div><div>PS. <i>Please also note that I am monitoring a bug that may cause images to be plotted upside-down on non-macOS platforms. I believe I fixed this in the release version, but can&#39;t currently test the fix (since I can&#39;t reproduce it on my personal machine and won&#39;t have access to test on another machine before release). If you experience this, please note that it will be high priority to fix in release as soon as I can.</i><br></div>"
